@@s004 How to train
@@s005 Open an exam, read only the text of the 5 problems, classify them with the triage, then compare with the paradigm column. These are 79 problems from the uploaded exams, from the most recent. They are not solutions: the classification and the key idea are those of the course, drawn from the uploaded files.
